---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Greek Invest"
  description={`Contact Greek Invest at ${SITE.email}: property shortlists, editorial corrections, and what to include so we can answer in one reply.`}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Contact</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-6">
      Editorial questions and corrections: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      For property shortlists, use the form below or{' '}
      <a
        href={`${SITE.whatsapp}?text=Hi%2C%20I%20need%20help%20with%20a%20property%20enquiry%20from%20Greek%20Invest.`}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        data-wa-placement="footer_contact"
        data-cta="whatsapp_contact_page"
      >
        message us on WhatsApp
      </a>.
      We usually reply within one business day, Monday to Friday, Athens time (EET/EEST).
    </p>

    <div class="prose text-sm mb-10">
      <h2>What to include</h2>
      <p>
        The more of this you give us, the more useful the first reply is. Most enquiries can be answered
        in one message if we know:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your budget in euros, and whether it is cash or part-financed</li>
        <li>Whether the goal is a Golden Visa, rental income, a home to use, or a mix</li>
        <li>Region or regions you are weighing up — Athens, the Riviera, Crete, the Cyclades, the Peloponnese</li>
        <li>Your nationality and current tax residence, because both change the tax and permit path</li>
        <li>Roughly when you want to complete</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we can and cannot answer</h2>
      <p>
        We can explain how a rule works, which Golden Visa tier a location falls into, what a purchase
        actually costs once taxes and fees are counted, and which questions to put to a lawyer. We cannot
        give personalised legal or tax advice, run a title search, or confirm that a specific property
        qualifies — that is regulated work, and we will point you to licensed Greek professionals who do
        it. See <a href="/about/">about</a> and the <a href="/methodology/">methodology page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Found a mistake?</h2>
      <p>
        Greek thresholds and tax bands move, sometimes twice in a year. If a figure on any page looks
        wrong or out of date, email us the page and the number. We correct the page and update its date,
        and we are glad to be told.
      </p>

      <h2>Enquiry data</h2>
      <p>
        What you send is used to answer your enquiry, and shared with licensed Greek lawyers or partner
        agents only where the enquiry needs regulated work. We do not sell data or add you to marketing
        lists. Full detail in the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <LeadForm context="Contact page" />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
